{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年36歲的王灝兒（JW）去年中傳出戀上從事演唱會事業的足球班主王至尊（Jim Wong），早前更傳出兩人已於去年11月在土耳其秘婚。</p><p>JW日前推出新歌《JW2情歌》時正式認愛，透露新歌正是她與王至尊的愛情故事，並以喜帖形式邀請歌迷一同見證兩人展開人生新一頁。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:48.811437+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:27.435887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:24.045291+00:00","content_hash":"6e25e4b3c81357961014ff7423c23560110aeab770c0cc051bd645cc6688d25c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}